        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Muhammad: (101:11) \u0646\u064e\u0627\u0631\u064c \u062d\u064e\u0627\u0645\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0629\u064c\u06e2",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \u0647\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0647\u0652",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Muhammad:",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " (101:11)",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0646\u064e\u0627\u0631\u064c",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \u062d\u064e\u0627\u0645\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0629\u064c\u06e2",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That Narun (\u0646\u064e\u0627\u0631\u064c) and Jahim (\u062c\u064e\u062d\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064e) Dr. Khalifa: Yes, yes.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Muhammad",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " That",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " Narun",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " (\u0646\u064e\u0627\u0631\u064c)",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " Jahim",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " (\u062c\u064e\u062d\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064e)",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " Dr.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yes,",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And in Sura 102 (102:6) \u0644\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0648\u064f\u0646\u0651\u064e \u0671\u0644\u0652\u062c\u064e\u062d\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064e",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Muhammad",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " yes.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sura",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " 102",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " (102:6)",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0644\u064e\u062a\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0648\u064f\u0646\u0651\u064e",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \u0671\u0644\u0652\u062c\u064e\u062d\u0650\u064a\u0645\u064e",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "which is translated here to [102:6]  You would envision Hell.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Muhammad",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
