          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " translated",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " here",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " [102:6]",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": "  You",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " would",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " envision",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Hell.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this [101:11]  The blazing Hellfire.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Muhammad",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " [101:11]",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": "  The",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        },
        {
          "word": " blazing",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Muhammad"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Hellfire.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It's all allegorical, all of it.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " It's",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " all",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " allegorical,",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " all",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You see, the first, yeah, the first... At the very beginning of the Quran, when God talked about Heaven and Hell, He told us this is allegorical.",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " it.",
