          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " our",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But I don't feel sorry for him, because he was fighting God actively, and he insisted on going to Hell.",
