          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I'm not going in this masjid unless you add Muhammad to the Azan (Call to Prayer).",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " mosque.",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"I'm",
