          "word": " Yes,",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 3481.16,
          "end": 3481.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They decided to go astray, so God says \"all right, if you're committed down this road, go.\" Dr. Khalifa: Yes.",
