          "speaker": "Ismail Barakat"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, it's their two key words.  (4:115) \u0646\u064f\u0648\u064e\u0644\u0651\u0650\u0647\u0650\u06e6 \u0645\u064e\u0627 \u062a\u064e\u0648\u064e\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0649\u0670",
      "start": 3481.16,
      "end": 3481.16,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
